RELAXED_BOX 71.6499638767882 71.6450494056848 71.6448357291374

# These formulas define the derivatives w.r.t. strain components
# Constants uses $, variables use v_
variable d1 equal -(v_pxx1-${pxx0})/(v_delta/v_len0)*${cfac}
variable d1 equal -(v_pxx1-12.4973245870144)/(v_delta/v_len0)*${cfac}
variable d1 equal -(v_pxx1-12.4973245870144)/(v_delta/v_len0)*0.0001
